            <param name="style" value="1" />
            <param name="font" value="1" />
            <param name="fg_color" value="0" />
            <param name="bg_color" value="15792890" />
          </paramlist><![CDATA[The time-domain simulation consists of three stages:

1. Initialization (t = 0–2.5 s): The IT load is initialized to 0.7 pu.

2. The UPS switches to bypass mode at t = 2.5 s, and switches back to normal mode at t=3.5s.

3. The IT load is maintaned at  0.7 pu.
]]></Sticky>
